<title>FRANCE: Suez Lyonnaise targets Europe on communications.</title>
<headline>Suez Lyonnaise targets Europe on communications.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The company being formed by the proposed merger of Cie de Suez and Lyonnaise des Eaux SA will limit its communications ambitions to Europe, Guy de Panafieu, one of the members designated to the new company's management board, said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Our ambition in communications falls in a European, not a global, framework,&quot; he told an analysts' meeting. He said the group would seek partnerships to speed up its expansion in the field.</p>
<p>Industry analysts speculate Suez-Lyonnaise may team up with Bouygues on telecommunications.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
